│ The core of the problem lies in how bulk_create handles batch      │
│ size. The current implementation appears to be overriding the      │
│ intended automatic calculation of the optimal batch size by using  │
│ a fixed value. This can lead to suboptimal performance, especially │
│ when dealing with large datasets. The issue description correctly  │
│ points out that bulk_update handles this more gracefully, using    │
│ min(batch_size, max_batch_size).  The goal is to replicate this    │
│ behavior in bulk_create to ensure consistent and efficient batch   │
│ processing.                                                        │
